---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';

/**
 * Versão inglesa da Política de Cookies.
 *
 * Tradução do documento português, que continua a ser a versão de referência:
 * qualquer alteração feita lá tem de ser reflectida aqui. O conteúdo é
 * traduzido à mão (e não pelo dicionário de interface) porque é um documento
 * corrido, com tabela e notas próprias.
 *
 * TODO(cliente): a par do português, rever com apoio jurídico antes de
 * publicar.
 */
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Policy — Homeostase Vita"
  description="Which cookies this site uses, what they are for, and how you can change your choice at any time."
  heading="Cookie Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <h2>1. The essentials</h2>
  <p>
    This site does not set measurement cookies or load third-party content before you
    allow it. Until you choose, and if you decline, the site works in full — we simply
    do not collect usage statistics and the map is not loaded.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Which cookies exist</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Source</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>hv-consent</code></td>
        <td>This site</td>
        <td>
          Stores your choice about cookies. It stays in your browser and is not sent
          anywhere.
        </td>
        <td>Until you clear your browser data</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code></td>
        <td>Google Analytics 4</td>
        <td>Aggregated usage statistics. Only after you accept.</td>
        <td>Up to 2 years</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>_fbp</code></td>
        <td>Meta Pixel</td>
        <td>Measuring campaign results. Only after you accept.</td>
        <td>Up to 3 months</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Google Maps cookies</td>
        <td>Google</td>
        <td>
          Showing the clinic map. Only loaded if you click "Load map" or accept cookies.
        </td>
        <td>Set by Google</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>3. Changing your mind</h2>
  <p>
    You can review your choice at any time under
    <button type="button" class="link-gold" data-open-consent>Cookie settings</button>,
    also available in the footer of every page. You can also delete cookies directly in
    your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Questions</h2>
  <p>
    For any question about cookies or privacy, write to
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. See also our
    <a href="/en/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>

<style is:global>
  .prose code {
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background-color: var(--color-ivory);
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875em;
  }

  .prose button.link-gold {
    padding: 0;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-teal);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
